{\xe \v material.h\:aiBlendMode_Additive}
{\qr aiBlendMode_Additive{\bkmkstart AAAAAAACAN}
{\bkmkend AAAAAAACAN}
\cell }{{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Additive blending\par
Formula: {
\par
