{\qr aiShadingMode_Toon{\bkmkstart AAAAAAACAU}
{\bkmkend AAAAAAACAU}
\cell }{{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Toon-Shading per pixel\par
